    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Hryðeres belle, hundes hoppe, blæshorn—ðissa ðreora ælc bið anes scill' weorð; ⁊ ælc is melda geteald.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A cow's bell, a dog's collar and a horn for blowing—each of these shall be worth a shilling, and each is reckoned as an informer.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Pecoris tinnitum (tintinnum) et canis hoppa et bloþhorn (blauhornum): horum trium singulum est unum solidum ualens; et unumquodque reputatum est (reputatur) melda (id est manifestatio).</ab>
      </div>
